Package: wb-tsgo
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Enhances: wb-rules
Description: TypeScript compiler (Microsoft typescript-go)
 tsgo is Microsoft's native Go implementation of the TypeScript
 compiler, a tsc-compatible command-line tool
 (github.com/microsoft/typescript-go), installed unmodified as /usr/bin/tsgo (the upstream binary name).
 .
 wb-rules uses it to transpile and type-check TypeScript rule files
 (without it, .ts rule files are rejected with a clear error), but it is
 a standalone tool usable for any TypeScript work on the controller.
